{'symbol': 'AON', 'date': '2022-10-19 08:00:00', 'title': 'ANONOS SECURES $50 MILLION IN IP-BACKED FINANCING TO DELIVER DATA PRIVACY TECHNOLOGY WITH 100% ACCURACY AND UTILITY TO DATA-DRIVEN ENTERPRISES', 'text': 'NEW YORK & BRUSSELS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ANONOS, PROVIDER OF THE ONLY TECHNOLOGY THAT RESOLVES THE CONFLICT BETWEEN DATA USE AND PROTECTION WITH 100% ACCURACY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS RAISED $50 MILLION IN GROWTH FINANCING BACKED BY ITS INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY (IP) PORTFOLIO, FACILITATED BY AON (NYSE: AON) AND LED BY GT INVESTMENT PARTNERS (“GHOST TREE PARTNERS”).'}